                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is an absolute blast of a local multiplayer game - fast-paced, frenetic, exhilarating when you're winning and losing just makes you more focused on changing that. I love that it's intuitive (learnt how to play within a couple of minutes and felt totally familiar with everything at the 30 min mark).\n\nReally looking forward to getting a chance to play this with people again. Hoping there will be a solid bot-based single player mode in the final release, and I'll enjoy seeing the game develop :)",
